### 1. Info
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/info
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Accept: application/json

### 2. Cliente com chance de cancelar
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": 2,
  "MonthlyCharges": 95.5,
  "TotalCharges": 191.0,
  "SeniorCitizen": 1,
  "Contract": "Month-to-month",
  "InternetService": "Fiber optic",
  "PaymentMethod": "Electronic check",
  "TechSupport": "No"
}

### 3. Cliente que deve continuar
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": 60,
  "MonthlyCharges": 45.0,
  "TotalCharges": 2700.0,
  "SeniorCitizen": 0,
  "Contract": "Two year",
  "InternetService": "DSL",
  "PaymentMethod": "Bank transfer (automatic)",
  "TechSupport": "Yes"
}

### 4. Entrada invalida (deve dar 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": "invalido",
  "MonthlyCharges": 95.5,
  "TotalCharges": 191.0,
  "SeniorCitizen": 1,
  "Contract": "Month-to-month",
  "InternetService": "Fiber optic",
  "PaymentMethod": "Electronic check",
  "TechSupport": "No"
}
